Aggregate csv formatting.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts 'Assets:*' --format csv

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash,Main
account Assets:LongAccount
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash,Main  2.005 SEK
  Assets:LongAccount  10000 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

account,amount,commodity
"Assets:Cash,Main",2.005,SEK
Assets:LongAccount,10000,SEK
